durable for the customers.  So, no one has the best super clone watches better than us, with our master watch experts working day and night to make your experience memorable.</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_7"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_9  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="447" height="335" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="rolex waterproof" title="waterproof-01-min" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20480%20360%22%20width%3D%22480%22%20height%3D%22360%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 480w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20300%20225%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%22225%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 300w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20768%20576%22%20width%3D%22768%22%20height%3D%22576%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 768w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20510%20382%22%20width%3D%22510%22%20height%3D%22382%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 510w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20500%20375%22%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22375%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 500w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20447%20335%22%20width%3D%22447%22%20height%3D%22335%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 447w" sizes="(max-width: 447px) 100vw, 447px" class="wp-image-74368 lzl bjs" data-lzl-srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-480x360.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 480w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-300x225.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 300w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-768x576.jpg?lm=68FA9F5F 768w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-510x382.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 510w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-500x375.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 500w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-e1743054529555.jpg?lm=67E4E6C3 447w" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-e1743054529555.jpg?lm=67E4E6C3"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="447" height="335" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-e1743054529555.jpg?lm=67E4E6C3" alt="rolex waterproof" title="waterproof-01-min" srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-480x360.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 480w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-300x225.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 300w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-768x576.jpg?lm=68FA9F5F 768w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-510x382.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 510w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-500x375.jpg?lm=68FA9F5E 500w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/waterproof-01-min-e1743054529555.jpg?lm=67E4E6C3 447w" sizes="(max-width: 447px) 100vw, 447px" class="wp-image-74368"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_10  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3><span style="color: #ff0000;">Our 1:1 Swiss Super Clones Are Water Resistant.</span></h3> <p>All our <a href="https://superluxuryreps.com/difference-between-a-11-super-clone-and-a-factory-replica/">high-end replica watches use premium quality materials</a> to give the feeling of a luxury watch. We use 904L Stainless Steel in the watch bodies for our super clones, and it is resistant to scratches, corrosion, and accidental damage. It also gives an extraordinary shine and twinkle to the watch. Plus, some watches have rose gold or yellow gold plating, giving them a real-like look.</p> <p>Not to miss, our watches come with a water-resistant feature, making their usage easy around water. Feel free to flaunt them without worrying about moisture and water around. However, wearing them inside the water intentionally is not recommended.</p> <p>We don’t just claim “water-resistant” — we prove it.<br data-start="2193" data-end="2196">Each watch is <strong data-start="2210" data-end="2229">pressure-tested</strong> and fitted with <strong data-start="2246" data-end="2305">rubber gaskets, sealed crowns, and screw-down casebacks</strong>, ensuring reliable protection from everyday splashes and humidity.</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_8"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_11  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_4"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="447" height="298" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="sapphire glass" title="sapphire glass" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20480%20320%22%20width%3D%22480%22%20height%3D%22320%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 480w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20300%20200%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%22200%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 300w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20500%20334%22%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22334%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 500w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20447%20298%22%20width%3D%22447%22%20height%3D%22298%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 447w" sizes="(max-width: 447px) 100vw, 447px" class="wp-image-74367 lzl bjs" data-lzl-srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-480x320.jpg?lm=68FA9F5A 480w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-300x200.jpg?lm=68FA9F59 300w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-500x334.jpg?lm=68FA9F5A 500w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-e1743054467189.jpg?lm=67E4E685 447w" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-e1743054467189.jpg?lm=67E4E685"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="447" height="298" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-e1743054467189.jpg?lm=67E4E685" alt="sapphire glass" title="sapphire glass" srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-480x320.jpg?lm=68FA9F5A 480w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-300x200.jpg?lm=68FA9F59 300w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-500x334.jpg?lm=68FA9F5A 500w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rolex-370-9-min-e1743054467189.jpg?lm=67E4E685 447w" sizes="(max-width: 447px) 100vw, 447px" class="wp-image-74367"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_12  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3><span style="color: #e02b20;">We Use Sapphire Crystal To Make Superclone Watches</span></h3> <h3></h3> <p>The replica watches we are selling are poles apart from the standard replicas you can find at random places. The level of detailing in our watches is exceptional, plus these watches are made with high-grade and durable materials such as 904L stainless steel and sapphire crystal and equipped with Swiss Cloned movements. These are the attributes of real luxury watches, and finding them in a replica is more than desirable. Our super clone watches also have the exact same finishing, printing, engravings, serial numbers and embellishments.</p> <p>No one can reach this level of detailing without understanding the horology. Lucky that we have a team of expert level horologists for it, which can reverse-engineer these watches beating the original. The accuracy of the designs and detailing has earned Superluxuryreps a prime spot as the best replica watch seller online.</p> <p>Contrary to what most people think, our superclones are made with high-quality sapphire crystal, providing a practical experience for these watches. This material gives a scratch-free experience, plus the anti-reflective coating on this dial makes it recognizable even from a long distance.</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_9"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_13  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_5"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="457" height="305" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="best super clone watches" title="best super clone watches" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20457%20305%22%20width%3D%22457%22%20height%3D%22305%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 457w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20300%20200%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%22200%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 300w" sizes="(max-width: 457px) 100vw, 457px" class="wp-image-80071 lzl bjs" data-lzl-srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/DSC09786-Edit-1-1.webp?lm=68DF159E 457w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/DSC09786-Edit-1-1-300x200.webp?lm=68DF159E 300w" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/DSC09786-Edit-1-1.webp?lm=68DF159E"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="457" height="305" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/DSC09786-Edit-1-1.webp?lm=68DF159E" alt="best super clone watches" title="best super clone watches" srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/DSC09786-Edit-1-1.webp?lm=68DF159E 457w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/DSC09786-Edit-1-1-300x200.webp?lm=68DF159E 300w" sizes="(max-width: 457px) 100vw, 457px" class="wp-image-80071"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_14  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_7  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3><span style="color: #e02b20;"></span></h3> <h3 data-start="1920" data-end="1949"><span style="color: #e02b20;">Meet Your Watch Experts</span></h3> <p data-start="1956" data-end="2150"><strong data-start="1956" data-end="1997">Matt – Watch Concierge &amp; Quality Guru</strong><br data-start="1997" data-end="2000">With over a decade of experience in horology and replica watch sourcing, Matt personally oversees QC and handles your inquiries via chat or video.</p> <p data-start="2157" data-end="2339"><strong data-start="2157" data-end="2178">The Crafting Team</strong><br data-start="2178" data-end="2181">Our skilled watchmakers and polishers, trained in working with 904L steel and Swiss-clone movements, are committed to delivering perfection in every detail.</p> <h3></h3> <p> </p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_10"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_15  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_6"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="457" height="305" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews (1)" title="A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews (1)" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20457%20305%22%20width%3D%22457%22%20height%3D%22305%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 457w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20300%20200%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%22200%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 300w" sizes="(max-width: 457px) 100vw, 457px" class="wp-image-80072 lzl bjs" data-lzl-srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews-1.webp?lm=68DF15A2 457w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews-1-300x200.webp?lm=68DF15A2 300w" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews-1.webp?lm=68DF15A2"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="457" height="305" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews-1.webp?lm=68DF15A2" alt="A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews (1)" title="A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews (1)" srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews-1.webp?lm=68DF15A2 457w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/A-5-star-Guide-For-Earning-More-Customer-Reviews-1-300x200.webp?lm=68DF15A2 300w" sizes="(max-width: 457px) 100vw, 457px" class="wp-image-80072"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_16  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_8  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3 data-start="213" data-end="253">🛠️ <span style="color: #e02b20;">Complimentary After-Sales Care</span></h3> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A watch should not become a problem after it arrives.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>If your bracelet breaks, the clasp fails, or you need extra links for sizing, <strong>we can send replacement parts free of charge</strong>. If the issue is bigger than a simple part replacement, we will review the case and help arrange a proper fix or replacement piece.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>That support is included with your purchase.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Super clone watches are still mechanical watches. Links can loosen, clasps can wear, crowns may need adjustment, and movements sometimes need attention. The important thing is simple: <strong>after delivery, you are not left on your own.</strong></span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Need bracelet parts? Contact us.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Need extra links? We can help.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Something feels off after wearing the watch? Send photos or a short video and we will review it.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Most sellers focus only on shipping the order. We focus on what happens after the watch is actually on your wrist.</span></p> <p><strong>Built for Buyers Who Compare Factory Versions</strong></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Most buyers do not order the first super clone watch they see.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>They compare factories. They check whether VSF or Clean made the better Submariner this year. They look at Daytona case thickness, bracelet taper, crystal height, bezel alignment, and date window position.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>That is why SuperLuxuryReps keeps the buying process focused on the details that matter.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Each listing is built around clear information: factory version, movement type, case size, bracelet style, crystal quality, bezel material, real photos, and QC before shipping whenever available.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Two watches can have the same model name and still feel completely different in hand. One batch may have the better case. Another may have the better bracelet. One version may fix the dial but still have a weaker clasp.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Those differences matter once the watch arrives.</span></p> <p><strong>Quality You Notice in the Small Parts</strong></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A weak replica usually gives itself away before anyone studies the dial.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The bracelet rattles. The clasp feels hollow. The bezel does not line up cleanly. The crown feels rough when you screw it back in. The case edges look rounded instead of sharp.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Better super clone watches feel different because the small parts are finished properly.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The case shape is cleaner. The bracelet feels tighter. The clasp closes firmly. The crystal sits better in the case. The bezel action feels more controlled.</span></p> <p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Most first-time buyers focus on the dial. Experienced buyers usually check the bracelet, crown, bezel, and clasp first.</span></p> <p><span>A good dial on a loose bracelet still feels cheap. A solid bracelet with clean case finishing changes the whole watch.</span></p> <p data-start="3264" data-end="3293"><strong>Price Without the Theater</strong></p> <p data-start="3295" data-end="3570">Let’s be realistic: nobody shopping for super clone watches expects bargain-bin pricing. The good ones cost more because they’re made better — heavier steel, sapphire crystals, ceramic inserts, clone calibers instead of cheap automatics with decorative plates slapped on top.</p> <p data-start="3572" data-end="3766">What draws people in is that the numbers still feel… rational. You’re paying for machining, finishing, and updated tooling — not for marble floors in a boutique or champagne in a waiting lounge.</p> <p data-start="3768" data-end="3935">It’s the kind of purchase where you sit back afterward and think, <em data-start="3834" data-end="3878">yeah, that makes sense for what I just got</em>, rather than wondering if you acted on impulse at 2 a.m.</p> <p data-start="3942" data-end="3970"><strong>What Buyers Actually Say</strong></p> <p data-start="3972" data-end="4110">This is where things usually fall apart for sketchy sellers. Stock photos, copied testimonials, vague praise that could apply to anything.</p> <p data-start="4112" data-end="4422">Here, most of the feedback goes straight for tactile stuff: how solid the clasp feels, how the polish compares to a gen they handled once, whether the watch needed regulation out of the box. People post wrist shots, mention shipping timelines, complain about tiny delays, then follow up when the piece arrives.</p> <p data-start="4424" data-end="4529">That mix — praise plus nitpicking — is usually a good sign. Fake reviews are too clean. Real ones wander.</p> <p data-start="4536" data-end="4579"><strong>Customer Service, Without the Runaround</strong></p> <p data-start="4581" data-end="4755">Buying anything expensive online makes people nervous, especially in a niche like this. So the bar is simple: answer messages, explain options, don’t disappear after payment.</p> <p data-start="4757" data-end="4974">From what buyers describe, SuperLuxuryReps leans hard into that side of things. Sizing help. Factory comparisons. <a href="https://superluxuryreps.com/what-are-qc-videos-and-why-they-matter-when-buying-super-clone-watches/">QC photos and videos</a> before shipping. A chance to approve the actual watch instead of rolling the dice.</p> <p data-start="4976" data-end="5168">And when something isn’t right? Exchanges and fixes come up more than once in reviews — not in a dramatic way, but in that low-key “took a bit, but they handled it” tone that feels believable.</p> <p data-start="5170" data-end="5283">No brand likes to advertise problems. The fact that people talk about how they were resolved is more interesting.</p> <p data-start="5290" data-end="5326"><strong>A Straightforward Buying Process</strong></p> <p data-start="5328" data-end="5535">The site itself is built around showing rather than telling. Clear specs. Version labels. Actual product photography. Payment pages that don’t feel like you’ve wandered into a sketchy corner of the internet.</p> <p data-start="5537" data-end="5672">Encrypted checkout, PayPal options, QC approval before dispatch — all pretty standard now, but still surprisingly rare in this segment.</p> <p data-start="5674" data-end="5993">There’s also something refreshing about not overselling. Most descriptions stick to materials, movements, and factory info instead of wild claims about “indistinguishable perfection.” Anyone deep enough into replicas knows nothing is magic. What you want is accuracy, consistency, and honesty about what you’re getting.</p> <p data-start="6000" data-end="6044"><strong>How the Watches Come Across on the Wrist</strong></p> <p data-start="6046" data-end="6132">This part is hard to explain until you’ve handled one, so take it for what it’s worth.</p> <p data-start="6134" data-end="6362">The better super clones don’t feel like props. They feel like machines. Solid mid-cases. Smooth bracelet articulation. Clasp tolerances that don’t chew into your wrist hair. Bezels that click with confidence instead of wobbling.</p> <p data-start="6364" data-end="6442">Maybe I’m overselling the bracelet thing — but people always notice bracelets.</p> <p data-start="6444" data-end="6481">That’s usually where corners get cut.</p> <h3></h3> <h3></h3></div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 nofollow-links et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_11"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_17  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_9  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3 style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>AS FEATURED ON </strong></span></h3></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_12"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_18  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_7"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="970" height="400" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="98384f80 7241 11eb bfef f660fde6ffaf" title="yahoo finance" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20970%20400%22%20width%3D%22970%22%20height%3D%22400%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 970w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20480%20198%22%20width%3D%22480%22%20height%3D%22198%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 970px, 100vw" class="wp-image-80322 lzl bjs" data-lzl-srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/98384f80-7241-11eb-bfef-f660fde6ffaf.webp?lm=68E534FC 970w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/98384f80-7241-11eb-bfef-f660fde6ffaf-480x198.webp?lm=68E534FC 480w" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/98384f80-7241-11eb-bfef-f660fde6ffaf.webp?lm=68E534FC"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="970" height="400" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/98384f80-7241-11eb-bfef-f660fde6ffaf.webp?lm=68E534FC" alt="98384f80 7241 11eb bfef f660fde6ffaf" title="yahoo finance" srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/98384f80-7241-11eb-bfef-f660fde6ffaf.webp?lm=68E534FC 970w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/98384f80-7241-11eb-bfef-f660fde6ffaf-480x198.webp?lm=68E534FC 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 970px, 100vw" class="wp-image-80322"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_19  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_8"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="254" height="58" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="logo e1743108414356" title="logo" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20300%2069%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2269%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 300w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20480%20110%22%20width%3D%22480%22%20height%3D%22110%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 480w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20500%20115%22%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22115%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 500w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20254%2058%22%20width%3D%22254%22%20height%3D%2258%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 254w" sizes="(max-width: 254px) 100vw, 254px" class="wp-image-11041 lzl bjs" data-lzl-srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-300x69.png?lm=67773129 300w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-480x110.png?lm=67773129 480w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-500x115.png?lm=67773129 500w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-e1743108414356.png?lm=67E5B940 254w" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-e1743108414356.png?lm=67E5B940"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="254" height="58" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-e1743108414356.png?lm=67E5B940" alt="logo e1743108414356" title="logo" srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-300x69.png?lm=67773129 300w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-480x110.png?lm=67773129 480w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-500x115.png?lm=67773129 500w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/logo-e1743108414356.png?lm=67E5B940 254w" sizes="(max-width: 254px) 100vw, 254px" class="wp-image-11041"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_20  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_9"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="254" height="110" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="bizzbuzz" title="bizzbuzz" class="wp-image-75069 lzl bjs" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logo-new.webp?lm=67E4D377"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="254" height="110" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logo-new.webp?lm=67E4D377" alt="bizzbuzz" title="bizzbuzz" class="wp-image-75069"></noscript></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_21  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_10"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="254" height="60" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="dna" title="dna" class="wp-image-75070 lzl bjs" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logo-1-1-1.webp?lm=67E4D41D"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="254" height="60" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/logo-1-1-1.webp?lm=67E4D41D" alt="dna" title="dna" class="wp-image-75070"></noscript></span> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_4 et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_13"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_22  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_heading et_pb_heading_1 et_pb_bg_layout_"> <div class="et_pb_heading_container"><h3 class="et_pb_module_heading">FREQUENLTY ASKED QUESTIONS</h3></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_14"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_23  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_0 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: What is the difference between V2 and V3 Super Clones?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p><strong>Accuracy &amp; Built</strong></p> <p>V2: Minor flaws in dials, engravings, or materials. Noticeable to experts.<br>V3: Near-identical details, sharper engravings, and premium materials.</p> <p><strong>Movement</strong></p> <p>V2: Functional but less reliable; may lose/gain time.<br>V3: Upgraded mechanics (e.g., cloned Swiss movements), better accuracy (±5-10 sec/day).</p> <p><strong>Materials</strong></p> <p>V2: Lower-tier metals/glass; may scratch or discolor.<br>V3: High-end materials matching genuine watches (weight, finish, durability).</p> <p><strong>Functionality</strong></p> <p>V2: Water resistance often unreliable (e.g., 50m rating but fails in practice).<br>V3: Improved sealing (100m+ resistance), smoother bezel/crown operation.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_1 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: What is the quality of your replica watches?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Our watches are 1:1 exact replicas, made with the same high quality materials and craftsmanship as the original. Each watch is inspected by our experts to ensure the highest quality standard before it is shipped. Every replica watch is made to look and feel just like the original.</p> <p>Our <strong data-start="709" data-end="729">1:1 super clones</strong> are <strong data-start="734" data-end="754">95–99% identical</strong> to the originals in weight, size, engravings, and movement. Even experienced collectors often struggle to tell the difference.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_2 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Do your watches come with a warranty?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Yes, every watch comes with a 2 Year <strong data-start="962" data-end="1007">warranty and lifetime after-sales support</strong>. We also provide free replacement parts like clasps, bracelets, and extra links.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_3 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: What happens if my shipment is seized by customs? What is your protocol?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>A: In the rare event that a package is held or seized by customs,  We work with trusted shipping partners and discreet packaging to minimize this risk, but if it does occur, we’ll review the situation on a case-by-case basis and either reship you a new watch, with no extra cost to you.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_4 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Do you provide photos or proof before shipping?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Yes — we send <strong data-start="1429" data-end="1458">QC photos and video proof</strong> of your exact watch before shipment. This ensures you know exactly what you’ll receive.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_5 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: If the package is lost or stolen, what compensation or replacement do you provide?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p data-start="1031" data-end="1383">A: All shipments are tracked and insured until delivery. If your package is lost or stolen in transit, we will either reship your order at no additional cost or issue a replacement. Our goal is to make sure you receive your watch with complete peace of mind.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_6 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Do you provide spare parts or replacement parts separately?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p data-start="5339" data-end="5575">A: Yes. We offer replacement parts like clasps, extra links, bracelets, or crystals. If something breaks or needs adjustment, contact our support and we’ll assist you.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_7 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: How long does shipping take?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p data-start="1550" data-end="1725">Worldwide shipping usually takes <strong data-start="1621" data-end="1643">7–14 business days</strong>, depending on your location. We use discreet packaging to avoid customs issues. </p> <p data-start="1727" data-end="1901"></p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_8 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Do your super clone watches glow in the dark?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p data-start="2566" data-end="2724">Yes, many of our watches feature <strong data-start="2654" data-end="2687">luminescent markers and hands</strong>, just like genuine luxury watches.</p> <p data-start="2726" data-end="2940"> </p><p data-start="1727" data-end="1901"></p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_9 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: If the movement fails after the warranty, can I buy a replacement movement from you?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p data-start="2566" data-end="2724"><span>A: Yes. Even if your warranty period has ended which is 2 years, we can supply replacement movements or arrange repair service at a reasonable cost. Simply contact our support team with your order number and model details, and we’ll provide options for parts and servicing.</span></p> <p data-start="2726" data-end="2940"> </p><p data-start="1727" data-end="1901"></p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_10 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Will I have to pay customs or import fees?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p data-start="1903" data-end="2133">Some countries mostly Europe may apply customs duties or VAT, which is total around $30, only if we are doing fast shipping which takes 4-8 days. We minimize this risk by using <strong data-start="2034" data-end="2073">discreet and slow, low-value shipping labels</strong>, but customers are responsible for any local import fees.</p> <p data-start="1727" data-end="1901"></p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_11 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Can anyone tell I’m wearing a replica?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p data-start="1092" data-end="1315">Our super clones are made to <strong data-start="1169" data-end="1220">mirror authentic luxury watches in every detail</strong>. Unless someone is an expert watchmaker opening the caseback, they will not be able to tell.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_12 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: What Payment methods do you accept for 1:1 Super clone watches?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>We accept payments via PayPal, VISA, Mastercard, Western Union, American Express, Zelle, Crypto Payments, and other secure payment methods. We also accept bank transfers and wire transfers. For more information, please contact our customer support team at <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="4132202d24320132343124332d3439343338332431326f222e2c">[email&#160;protected]</a></p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_13 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: What's the difference between Swiss and Japanese Movements?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Swiss movements are known for their precision, accuracy, and long lifespan, making them the highest quality movements in the luxury watch industry. Japanese movements are precise and reliable. They are practical, focusing more on accuracy and affordability rather than design of movement.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_14 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Is it legal to buy a super clone watch?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Yes, you can buy replica watches in many countries. We ship our watches worldwide and don’t have customs issues. You can buy these watches in countries like the USA, Canada, Australia, Ireland, France, Israel, Netherlands, Germany, and Italy. Learn more about the legality of replica watches.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_15 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Who makes &amp; sells the best replica watches?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>Factories like Clean, 3K, ZF, and JF make the top replica watches. Superluxuryreps Shop carefully selects and compares them to the originals before shipping globally, ensuring a satisfying shopping experience.</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_16 et_pb_toggle_item  et_pb_toggle_close"> <h5 class="et_pb_toggle_title">Q: Where to buy super clone watches?</h5> <div class="et_pb_toggle_content clearfix"><p>You can find super clone watches on various online replica watch websites and in watch markets in China. If you’re looking for a super clone watch that looks just like the original, superluxuryreps.com Shop is a good choice. We are official sellers of Clean Factory, APS, QF etc.</p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </article> </div> <footer class="et-l et-l--footer"> <div class="et_builder_inner_content et_pb_gutters2"><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_0_tb_footer et_pb_with_background et_section_regular"> <div class="et_pb_with_border et_pb_row et_pb_row_0_tb_footer et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters2"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et_pb_column_0_tb_footer  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0_tb_footer"> <a href="#" data-lzl-clk-nodef="*"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img decoding="async" width="512" height="512" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="superluxury cropped" title="superluxury cropped" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20512%20512%22%20width%3D%22512%22%20height%3D%22512%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 512w, data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20480%20480%22%20width%3D%22480%22%20height%3D%22480%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 512px, 100vw" class="wp-image-9421 lzl bjs" data-lzl-srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cropped-wtlogo.png?lm=6768E615 512w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cropped-wtlogo-480x480.png?lm=6768E617 480w" data-lzl-src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cropped-wtlogo.png?lm=6768E615"><noscript lzl=""><img decoding="async" width="512" height="512" src="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cropped-wtlogo.png?lm=6768E615" alt="superluxury cropped" title="superluxury cropped" srcset="https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cropped-wtlogo.png?lm=6768E615 512w, https://superluxuryreps.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/cropped-wtlogo-480x480.png?lm=6768E617 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 512px, 100vw" class="wp-image-9421"></noscript></span></a> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0_tb_footer  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p><strong>Email</strong><s